      "text": "Step 1: Consider the general term in the numerator and denominator of the given expression. For any positive integer \\( k \\), we have the terms \\( (2k)^4 + \\frac{1}{4} \\) in the numerator and \\( (2k-1)^4 + \\frac{1}{4} \\) in the denominator.",
