      "text": "Step 3: Apply the Sophie Germain identity to \\( x^4 + \\frac{1}{4} \\):\n\\[ x^4 + \\frac{1}{4} = \\left( x^2 - x + \\frac{1}{2} \\right) \\left( x^2 + x + \\frac{1}{2} \\right). \\]",
